        <p class="hero-sub">Convert American shoe sizes to Japanese shoe sizes instantly. Explore comprehensive conversion tables, JIS metric centimeters, brand fit guides for Onitsuka Tiger, ASICS, and Nike, plus dual-unit width breakdowns.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span class="stat-label">Men's Standard</span>
            <span class="stat-val">US 9.0 = 27.0 cm (JP)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span class="stat-label">Women's Standard</span>
            <span class="stat-val">US 7.5 = 24.5 cm (JP)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span class="stat-label">System Standard</span>
            <span class="stat-val">JIS Metric (CM / MM)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator -->
    <section class="converter-band">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <div class="card-elevated conv-card">
          <div class="conv-card-header">
            <h2 class="heading-md">Convert US to Japan Shoe Size</h2>
            <p class="conv-card-sub">Select your gender category and American (US) shoe size to compute your exact Japanese size in centimetres, Mondopoint millimeters, and European equivalents.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="conv-row">
            <div class="conv-field">
              <label class="step-label" for="conv-gender">
                <span class="step-num">1</span> Category
              </label>
              <select id="conv-gender" class="form-select" aria-label="Select category">
                <option value="men" selected>Men's Sizes</option>
                <option value="women">Women's Sizes</option>
                <option value="kids">Kids' Sizes</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="conv-field">
              <label class="step-label" for="conv-size">
                <span class="step-num">2</span> American (US) Size
              </label>
              <select id="conv-size" class="form-select" aria-label="Select US shoe size">
                <option value="" disabled>Select US size</option>
