              <span class="snap-main">9.5 US to Japan Size → 27.5 cm</span>
              <span class="snap-detail">JP 27.5 · 275 mm · EU 42.5 · UK 9.0 · 10.8 inches</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="snap-card">
            <span class="snap-tag">Men's Benchmark</span>
            <div class="snap-body">
              <span class="snap-main">10.5 Shoe Size in Japan → 28.5 cm</span>
