            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="snap-card">
            <span class="snap-tag">EU to JP Benchmark</span>
            <div class="snap-body">
              <span class="snap-main">38 Shoe Size in Japan → 24.0 cm</span>
              <span class="snap-detail">EU 38.0 · US Women 7.0 · US Men 6.0 · 240 mm</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="snap-card">
